/span></span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>of_json json</code> takes a <code>Yojson.Safe.t</code> and returns a <code>t</code>. Keys that can not be serialized safely will be removed from the list</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-of_string\"><a href=\"#val-of_string\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> of_string : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>of_string json_string</code> takes a JSON string representation and returns a <code>t</code>. Keys that can not be serialized safely will be removed from the list</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-to_string\"><a href=\"#val-to_string\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> to_string : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>to_string t</code> takes a t and returns a JSON string representation</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-find_key\"><a href=\"#val-find_key\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> find_key : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><a href=\"../Jwk/index.html#type-public\">Jwk.public</a> <a href=\"../Jwk/index.html#type-t\">Jwk.t</a></span> option</span></span></code></div></div>"}